' persistence/MyBatisRuntimeExecutionControlRepository.java:linkCommittedEvent,appendToSegment,markTerminal
' event/RuntimeCompactionEventProjector.java:persistCompaction
' modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/resources/mapper/session/RuntimeSessionMapper.xml:findCommittedEvent
' 已观察行为：user.message、续跑、Agent 输出和 idle 都关联到结果段；
' user.interrupt 只保存 targetEventId；执行内自动压缩尚未关联。
' 设计原因：复用根执行作为轮次身份，不新增轮次表。
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #425B70
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #8496A4
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 190
hide footbox
autonumber
title 解析并读取一个轮次（UC2，目标设计，待实现）
participant "Mate" as Mate
participant "事件查询" as Query
database "事件表" as Events
database "执行表" as Exec
Mate -> Query : GET sessionId + eventId 所在轮次\nlimit、afterEventId
Query -> Events : 按 (sessionId, eventId) 读取事件
Events --> Query : 事件类型和 payload
Query -> Exec : 按结果段关联或停止请求的目标定位执行
Exec --> Query : executionId、rootEventId、state
Query -> Events : 按 eventSeq 读取游标之后的关联事件\n和停止事件，取 limit + 1 条
Events --> Query : 一页已提交事件
Query -> Query : 用共享的 CommittedEventProjection 投影
Query --> Mate : rootEventId、finished、events、nextCursor
@enduml

